            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "Adom ne asomdwoeɛ a ɛfiri Agya Onyankopɔn ne yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo nka mo.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a5531092a820c41371",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.1.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50b3",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "Anuanom, ɛsɛ sɛ da biara yɛda Onyankopɔn ase ma mo. Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ saa, ɛfiri sɛ, mo gyidie ne ɔdɔ a modɔ afoforɔ no mu den ara na ɛreyɛ.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a5531092a820c41388",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.1.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50b3",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "Saa enti na yɛn ankasa yɛde mo hoahoa yɛn ho wɔ Onyankopɔn asafo ahodoɔ mu no. Yɛde ɔtaa ne amanehunu a mokɔ so gyina ano no hoahoa yɛn ho.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a5531092a820c413fd",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.1.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50b3",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "Yeinom nyinaa di adanseɛ sɛ, Onyankopɔn bu atɛntenenee ɛno enti, wɔbɛkan mo afra wɔn a wɔbɛkɔ nʼAhennie a morehunu ho amane no mu.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a5531092a820c4142c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.1.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50b3",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "Onyankopɔn bɛyɛ deɛ ɛtene. Wɔn a wɔbɛma mo ahunu amane no, ɔno nso bɛma wɔahunu amane,",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a5531092a820c4146c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.1.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50b3",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "na mo a mo ne yɛn rehunu amane no nso, wama moahome. Saa asɛm yi bɛsi wɔ ɛberɛ a Awurade Yesu nam ogyaframa mu firi ɔsoro reba a nʼabɔfoɔ atumfoɔ ka ne ho no,",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a5531092a820c4149a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.1.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50b3",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "abɛtwe wɔn a wɔnnim Onyankopɔn na wɔntie yɛn Awurade Yesu Asɛmpa no aso.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a5531092a820c414ec",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.1.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50b3",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "Wɔbɛkɔ daa ɔsɛeɛ mu na wɔayi wɔn afiri Awurade anim ne nʼanimuonyam mu",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a5531092a820c41538",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50b3",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "da a ɔbɛma nʼakyidifoɔ ne nʼasuafoɔ ahyɛ no animuonyam no. Mo nso, mobɛfra saa nkurɔfoɔ no mu, ɛfiri sɛ, moagye asɛm a yɛka kyerɛɛ mo no adi.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a5531092a820c41563",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50b3",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "Yei enti na daa yɛbɔ mpaeɛ ma mo no. Yɛsrɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔmma mo ntumi ntena ase mma asetena a ɛno enti ɔfrɛɛ mo no. Ɔnnyina ne tumi so mma mo tumi, nyɛ mo apɛdeɛ ne biribiara a mo gyidie bɛka akyerɛ mo sɛ monyɛ no nyinaa.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a5531092a820c415ac",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50b3",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.1",
        "content": "Yɛbɔ mpaeɛ sɛdeɛ monam yɛn Onyankopɔn ne Awurade Yesu Kristo adom so bɛhyɛ Awurade Yesu din animuonyam wɔ mo mu na mo nso, wɔahyɛ mo animuonyam wɔ ne mu.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a6531092a820c416ea",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
