            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Ɛfa yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo mmaeɛ a ɔrebɛba ne boa a wɔbɛboaboa yɛn ano akɔka ne ho no, mesrɛ mo, anuanom,",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a6531092a820c416fe",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "mommma mo adwene mu nnyɛ mo nnaa sɛ ɛda a Awurade reba no aduru. Ebia, na obi rehyɛ saa nkɔm no anaa obi foforɔ nso gyina so reka asɛm. Anaasɛ nso wɔka sɛ yɛn nwoma a yɛtwerɛeɛ no bi mu na saa asɛm no wɔ.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a6531092a820c4176c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Mommma obiara nnaadaa mo saa ɛkwan yi so. Saa Ɛda no remma da gye sɛ atuateɛ a ɛtwa toɔ no aba ama wɔada ɔbɔnefoɔ no a ɔbɛkɔ daa ɔsɛeɛ mu no adi.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a6531092a820c417ab",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Biribiara a nnipa som na wɔbu no kronkron no, ɔbɛtia mu. Ɔbɛkorɔn ne ho wɔ ne nyinaa so na wakɔtena Onyankopɔn asɔredan mu na waka sɛ ɔno ne Onyankopɔn.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a6531092a820c417cf",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Monkae sɛ ɛberɛ a me ne mo wɔ hɔ no, na metaa ka yeinom nyinaa kyerɛ mo.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a6531092a820c41812",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Nanso, biribi na atwe no asɛn, na sɛ ɛberɛ no duru a, ɔbɛba.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a6531092a820c4185a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Ɔbɔnefoɔ no di ne dwuma dada na deɛ ɛbɛba no remma da gye sɛ wɔayi deɛ ɔkura ne mu no afiri hɔ.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a6531092a820c418b6",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Ɛno ansa na ɔbɔnefoɔ no bɛba, na Awurade Yesu nam nʼanom home so bɛtu no agu, na ɔde ne ba a ɔbɛba no mu animuonyam asɛe no.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a6531092a820c418ec",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Ɔbɔnefoɔ no nam ɔbonsam tumi so na ɛbɛba na wabɛyɛ anwanwadeɛ ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ,",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a6531092a820c4192b",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.10",
