        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Yei enti, Onyankopɔn resoma nnaadaa tumi ma akɔhyɛ wɔn mu ama wɔagye nsɛm a ɛnyɛ nokorɛ adi.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a7531092a820c419c4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Awieeɛ no ara ne sɛ, wɔn a wɔnnye nokorɛ no nni na wɔn ani gye bɔne ho no, wɔbɛbu wɔn atɛn.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a7531092a820c41a12",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Anuanom, ɛsɛ sɛ ɛberɛ biara yɛda Onyankopɔn ase ma mo a Awurade dɔ mo no. Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnam Honhom no tumi so na Onyankopɔn yii mo sɛ nnipa a modi ɛkan a wɔbɛgye mo nkwa na wɔayɛ mo Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ kronkron wɔ mo gyidie a mowɔ wɔ nokorɛ mu no mu.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a7531092a820c41a5b",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Onyankopɔn nam Asɛmpa no so frɛɛ mo sɛdeɛ mo ne Awurade Yesu Kristo bɛtena nʼanimuonyam no mu.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a7531092a820c41a6a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Enti, anuanom, monnyina pintinn na monka mo ho mmata nokorɛ a yɛkyerɛɛ mo wɔ asɛnka ne yɛn nwoma no mu no.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a7531092a820c41a84",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "Yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo no ankasa ne yɛn Agya Onyankopɔn a ɔdɔ yɛn na ɔnam nʼadom mu ahyɛ yɛn daa nkuran ne anidasoɔ pa no,",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a7531092a820c41a9f",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.2.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50ce",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.2",
        "content": "nkyekyere mo werɛ, na ɔnhyɛ mo den asɛm ne adwuma pa nyinaa mu.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 2:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a7531092a820c41c62",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Anuanom, asɛm a ɛtwa toɔ ne sɛ, mommɔ mpaeɛ mma yɛn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Awurade asɛm bɛkɔ so atrɛ ntɛm sɛdeɛ ɛyɛɛ wɔ mo mu no.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a7531092a820c41c95",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Afei, mommɔ mpaeɛ mma yɛn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Onyankopɔn bɛyi yɛn afiri abɔnefoɔ ne nsɛmmɔnedifoɔ nsam. Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnyɛ nnipa nyinaa na wɔgye asɛm no di.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a7531092a820c41cc7",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Nanso, Awurade yɛ ɔnokwafoɔ. Ɔbɛhyɛ mo den na wagye mo afiri ɔbɔnefoɔ no nsam.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a7531092a820c41cf8",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Awurade ama yɛn mo mu anidasoɔ. Yɛwɔ anidasoɔ sɛ moreyɛ na mobɛkɔ so ayɛ biribiara a yɛbɛkyerɛ mo sɛ monyɛ no.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41d2e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Awurade nka mo ho na monnya ɔdɔ akoma sɛ Onyankopɔn ne abodwokyɛreɛ sɛ Kristo.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41d7f",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Anuanom, yɛhyɛ mo wɔ Awurade Yesu Kristo din mu sɛ, montwe mo ho mfiri anuanom a wɔdi aniha na wɔnni mmara a yɛahyɛ ama wɔn no so no ho.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41da4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Mo ankasa monim pefee sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ deɛ yɛyɛeɛ no bi pɛpɛɛpɛ. Ɛberɛ a na yɛwɔ mo nkyɛn no, yɛanyɛ aniha.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41def",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Obi ammoa yɛn a yɛantua onii no ka. Yɛyɛɛ adwuma dendeenden. Awia ne anadwo nyinaa yɛyɛɛ adwuma sɛdeɛ yɛremfa sikasɛm biara nha mo adwene.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41e0a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Yei nkyerɛ sɛ na yɛnni ho ɛkwan sɛ yɛbisa mo biribi de boa yɛn asetena. Yɛyɛɛ saa de yɛɛ nhwɛsoɔ maa mo.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41e2e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Yɛwɔ mo nkyɛn no, yɛka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, “Obiara a ɔmpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ adwuma no, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔma ɔdidi.”",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41e7f",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Yɛka saa asɛm yi, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛte sɛ mo mu bi yɛ anihafoɔ a wɔnyɛ hwee sɛ wɔnenam nkurɔfoɔ nnwuma ase.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41eb5",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Yɛde Awurade Yesu Kristo din hyɛ wɔn, bɔ wɔn kɔkɔ sɛ, wɔmmɔ bra pa na wɔnyɛ adwuma mfa mmɔ wɔn ho akɔnhoma.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41f1e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Anuanom monnnyae papayɛ da.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41f57",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Obi wɔ hɔ a ɔrentie nwoma a matwerɛ abrɛ mo yi mu nsɛm. Sɛ mohunu obi saa a, monhwɛ no yie na montwe mo ho mfiri ne ho na nʼanim ngu ase.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41f9a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Nanso, mommfa saa onipa no sɛ ɔyɛ ɔtamfoɔ na mmom, mommɔ no kɔkɔ sɛ mo nua.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c41fed",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd17999137613db5083"
        },
        "chapterId": "2TH.3",
        "content": "Na ɔno asomdwoeɛ Awurade no ara mma mo asomdwoeɛ daa adeɛ nyinaa mu. Awurade ne mo nyinaa ntena.",
        "reference": "2 Tesalonikafoɔ 3:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590a8531092a820c42035",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2TH.3.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2TH",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd17999137613db50f4",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2TH",
            "id": "2TH.3",
            "number": "3",
